          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to his people, “Do what is just and right, for soon I will save you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bless those who always observe the Sabbath and do not misuse it. I will bless those who do nothing evil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A foreigner who has joined the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people should not say, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will not let me worship with his people.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man who has been castrated should never think that because he cannot have children, he can never be part of God's people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to such a man, “If you honour me by observing the Sabbath and if you do what pleases me and faithfully keep my covenant, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then your name will be remembered in my Temple and among my people longer than if you had sons and daughters. You will never be forgotten.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
