          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", who has brought his people Israel home from exile, has promised that he will bring still other people to join them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has told the foreign nations to come like wild animals and devour his people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He says, “All the leaders, who are supposed to warn my people, are blind! They know nothing. They are like watchdogs that don't bark — they only lie about and dream. How they love to sleep! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are like greedy dogs that never get enough. These leaders have no understanding. They each do as they please and seek their own advantage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Let's get some wine,’ these drunkards say, ‘and drink all we can hold! Tomorrow will be even better than today!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
